* this one shows:* 1) literal fields* 2) left justified field with argument less than arg size* 3) right justified field with argument less than arg size* 4) centered field with argument less than arg size* 5) left justified field with no arg* 6) right justified field with no arg* 7) centered field with no arg dim a$:string[100] dim b$:string[10] dim c$:string[10] dim d$:string[10] print ".'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'.'" a$="This is a test |<<<<<| |>>>>>|^^^^^^^^| <<<<<>>>>>^^^^^^^end of line" b$="arg2" c$="arg3" d$="arg4" print using(a$,b$,c$,d$)